<title>POLAND: BFK Q2 net rises to PLN 12.4 mln.</title>
<headline>BFK Q2 net rises to PLN 12.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFK preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997. (Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    20.78   vs    15.19</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			18.57   vs    13.30</p>
<p>    net profit			    12.41   vs     8.48</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    101.02   vs    96.76</p>
<p>    costs of sales			69.54   vs    70.37</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs     0.05</p>
<p>    income tax			     6.15   vs     4.82</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.79   vs     1.78</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.00   vs     3.61</p>
<p>    investment			     8.37   vs     5.82</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    39.26   vs    24.41</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			35.67   vs    20.51</p>
<p>    net profit			    22.38   vs    12.56</p>
<p>    net sales			    186.64   vs   169.59</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     124.23   vs   123.75</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs     0.05</p>
<p>    income tax			    13.29   vs     7.94</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.02   vs     1.88</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.60   vs     5.73</p>
<p>    investment			    28.87   vs     9.38</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
